Cell["\<\
The pseudoscalar can be extracted as grade-3 element  from the list of \
orthonormal base, i.e, as\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.67489330530502*^9, 3.674893378389872*^9}, {
  3.674893498934907*^9, 3.67489356149292*^9}, {3.683129774975422*^9, 
